A NOTE ON THE DATA

The CSV files are a snapshot of product information that shops and brands
publish openly on their own websites, collected for academic research. The MIT
licence above covers the code.

The data is a different matter and I am not in a position to license it as if
it were mine. Product names, ingredient declarations and photographs belong to
the brands and shops that published them. Ingredient functions come from
CosIng, the European Commission's inventory, which is published under the
Commission's own reuse terms.

If you want to redistribute the data rather than the code, check those terms
first.
